=>'4 欄','5 Columns'=>'5 欄','6 Columns'=>'6 欄','<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>mandatory</em></strong> update that will migrate all user earnings and logs with their meta data to a new custom database table. This upgrade provides better performance and scalability.'=>'<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個 <strong><em>必須</em></strong>更新，會將所有使用者收入和日誌及其元資料遷移至新的自訂資料庫表。此升級提供更好的效能與擴充性。','<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>mandatory</em></strong> update that will update all logs with new database table fields. This upgrade provides better performance and scalability.'=>'<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個 <strong><em>必須</em></strong>更新，會以新的資料庫表欄位更新所有日誌。此升級提供更好的效能與擴充性。','<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>mandatory</em></strong> update that will update all requirements relationships (achievements and their steps, points types and their automatic awards and deducts, ranks and their requirements).'=>'<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個<strong><em>強制性</em></strong>更新，將會更新所有需求關係 (成就及其步驟、點數類型及其自動獎勵和扣除、等級及其需求)。','<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>mandatory</em></strong> update that will update all user earnings with new database table fields. This upgrade provides better performance and scalability.'=>'<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個 <strong><em>必須</em></strong>更新，會以新的資料庫表欄位更新所有使用者收入。此升級提供更好的效能與擴充性。','<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>mandatory</em></strong> update that will update the GamiPress logs adding some extra information on them to improve database queries.'=>'<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />這是一個<strong><em>強制性</em></strong>更新，將更新GamiPress日誌，增加一些額外的資訊，以改善資料庫查詢。','<strong>About this upgrade:</strong><br />This is a <strong><em>mandatory</em></strong> update that will update the GamiPress user earnings adding some extra information on earnings related to requirements.'=>'<strong>關於此升級：</strong><br />這是一個<strong><em>強制性</em></strong>更新，將更新GamiPress用戶的收益，增加一些額外的收益相關要求的信息。','<strong>Congratulations Text</strong> - The text displayed after achievement is earned.'=>'<strong>Congratulations Text</strong> - 贏得成就後顯示的文字。','<strong>Congratulations Text</strong> - The text displayed after rank is earned.'=>'<strong>恭喜文字</strong> - 贏得等級後顯示的文字。','<strong>Earned by</strong> - To define how this achievement can be earned. Choosing "Completing steps" will add a new box to configure the steps required.'=>'<strong>Earned by</strong> - 定義如何獲得此成就。選擇「完成步驟」會新增一個方塊來設定所需的步驟。','<strong>GamiPress cache</strong> cleared successfully!'=>'<strong>GamiPress 快取</strong>已成功清除！','<strong>Hidden</strong> - Checking this option will hide the achievement on frontend.'=>'<strong>Hidden</strong> - 勾選此選項會在前端隱藏成就。','<strong>Important!</strong> Just use this tool on a test environment or if really you know what are you doing.'=>'<strong>重要！</strong>請在測試環境中使用此工具，或者您真的知道自己在做什麼。','<strong>Important!</strong> User will not earn this requirements until be ranked on the previous rank.'=>'<strong>重要！</strong>使用者必須達到前一個等級，才能獲得此要求。','<strong>Important!</strong> Users on higher rank will be downgrade to this rank.'=>'<strong>重要！</strong>高階使用者會被降階到此階級。','<strong>Important:</strong> If emails to notify users about new earnings are enabled is possible that users will receive a lot of emails so is recommendable to deactivate them temporally.'=>'<strong>重要：</strong>如果啟用電子郵件通知使用者新的收益，使用者可能會收到大量電子郵件，因此建議暫時停用。','<strong>Important:</strong> If you set a tab title with special characters then provide a slug with URL friendly characters.'=>'<strong>重要：</strong>如果您設定的標籤標題含有特殊字符，請提供含有 URL 友善字元的標籤標題。','<strong>Maximum Earnings</strong> - Maximum number of times a user can earn the achievement. You can leave it empty for no maximum.'=>'<strong>Maximum Earnings</strong> - 賺取成就的最大次數。您可以留空表示沒有最大值。','<strong>Minimum Points Required</strong> <small>(Only if achievement is set up to earned by a minimum number of points)</small> - The fewest amount of points required to earn the achievement.'=>'<strong>所需的最低點數</strong> <small>(僅當成就設定為以最低點數獲得)</small>-獲得成就所需的最少點數。','<strong>Next Rank</strong> - Link to the next rank user can reach on complete this one.'=>'<strong>Next Rank</strong> - 連結至使用者完成此層級後可達到的下一層級。','<strong>Note:</strong> If the recount process fails, try to reduce this setting to a lower number to 50, 20 or 10 entries per loop.'=>'<strong>注意：</strong>如果重新計數過程失敗，請嘗試將此設定降低到較低的數字，例如每個循環 50、20 或 10 個項目。','<strong>Note:</strong> Some activity may not be possible to recount (like user log ins or daily visits) because there are not registries stored in the database.'=>'<strong>注意：</strong>有些活動可能無法重新計算（例如使用者登入或每日造訪），因為資料庫中沒有儲存註冊資料。','<strong>Note:</strong> This limit decides how many times this achievement can be earned on your site. Setting it to 10, for example, will limit this achievement to only the first 10 users who achieve it.'=>'<strong>注意：</strong>此限制決定在您的網站上可以獲得此成就的次數。例如，設定為 10 會限制此成就僅限於前 10 位取得此成就的使用者。','<strong>Note:</strong> To block users by role or block specific users, check the <a href="%s" target="_blank">GamiPress - Block Users</a> add-on.'=>'<strong>注意：</strong>若要依角色封鎖使用者或封鎖特定使用者，請檢查 <a href="%s" target="_blank">GamiPress-封鎖使用者</a>附加元件。','<strong>Note:</strong> You can drag and drop this options to reorder them. The order you set will affect to the order they will get displayed on the profile.'=>'<strong>注意：</strong>您可以拖放這些選項來重新排序。您設定的順序將影響它們在個人資料上的顯示順序。','<strong>Note:</strong> You can drag and drop this options to reorder them. The order you set will affect to the order they will get displayed on the reply details.'=>'<strong>注意：</strong>您可以拖放這些選項來重新排序。您設定的順序將影響它們在回覆詳細資訊中的顯示順序。','<strong>Note:</strong> You can drag and drop this options to reorder them. The order you set will affect to the order they will get displayed.'=>'<strong>注意：</strong>您可以拖放這些選項來重新排序。您設定的順序將影響它們的顯示順序。','<strong>Plural Name</strong> - The plural name for this %s.'=>'<strong>複數名稱</strong> - 這個 %s 的複數名稱。','<strong>Points Awarded</strong> - The amount of points to award to the user for earn the achievement (Optional).'=>'<strong>Points Awarded</strong> - 獎勵使用者獲得成就的點數 (選用)。','<strong>Points Type Required</strong> <small>(Only if achievement is set up to earned by a minimum number of points)</small> - The points type of the amount of points required to earn the achievement (Optional).'=>'<strong>Points Type Required</strong> <small>(僅當成就設定為以最低點數賺取)</small>-賺取成就所需的點數類型 (選用)。','<strong>Points Type</strong> - The points type of the amount of points to award (Optional).'=>'<strong>點數類型</strong> - 要獎勵的點數數量的點數類型 (選用)。','<strong>Previous Rank</strong> - Link to the previous rank that user needs to reach to start completing the requirements of the this one.'=>'<strong>Previous Rank</strong> - 連結到使用者需要達到的上一個等級，才能開始完成這個等級的要求。','<strong>Priority</strong> - The priority order of the rank.'=>'<strong>Priority</strong> - 排列的優先順序。','<strong>Rank Required</strong> <small>(Only if achievement is set up to earned by reaching a rank)</small> - The rank required to earn the achievement .'=>'<strong>Rank Required</strong> <small>(僅當成就設定為達到某個等級才能獲得)</small>-獲得成就所需的等級。','<strong>Rank Type Required</strong> <small>(Only if achievement is set up to earned by reaching a rank)</small> - The rank type of rank required to earn the achievement (Used to quickly filter the rank required options).'=>'<strong>Rank Type Required</strong> <small>(僅當成就設定為達到等級才能獲得)</small>-獲得成就所需的等級類型 (用來快速篩選等級需求選項)。','<strong>Sequential Requirements</strong> - Checking this option will force users to complete the requirements in order.'=>'<strong>Sequential Requirements</strong> - 勾選此選項會強制使用者依序完成需求。','<strong>Sequential Steps</strong> <small>(Only if achievement is set up to earned by completing steps)</small> - Checking this option will force users to complete the steps in order.'=>'<strong>Sequential Steps（順序步驟）</strong> <small>（僅當成就設定為透過完成步驟獲得）</small> - 勾選此選項會強制使用者依序完成步驟。','<strong>Show Earners</strong> - Checking this option will add 